BT 1 0 0 1 10 27.8 Tm .5 0 Td 12.2 TL 0 0 0 rg /F3+0 8.8 Tf 12.2 TL (Disease has a spectral signature.) Tj /F2+0 8.8 Tf 12.2 TL ( Infection lowers chlorophyll \(visible reflectance rises\), damages leaf and canopy) Tj T* -0.5 0 Td (structure \(NIR reflectance falls\) and restricts water flow \(canopy temperature rises\). Each effect is read in a different) Tj T* (spectral region \(Liu Y. 2026; Poblete 2023; Yuan 2025\).) Tj T* ET
