BT 1 0 0 1 10 27.8 Tm .5 0 Td -0.120802 Tw 12.2 TL 0 0 0 rg /F3+0 8.8 Tf 12.2 TL (The signal is measured at four levels.) Tj /F2+0 8.8 Tf 12.2 TL ( Leaf \(mm\002cm\), ground canopy \(about 1 m\003\), UAV \(1\00210 cm pixels over fields\) and) Tj T* 0 Tw -0.5 0 Td (satellite \(0.5\00220 m pixels over regions\). Finer levels see the disease clearly but cover little ground; coarser levels cover) Tj T* (large areas but mix healthy and diseased plants \(Zhao 2023; Blasch 2023\).) Tj T* ET
